# Power BI Desktop regenerates the .pbi/ folder every time this project is opened.
# It is NOT safe to publish. It contains:
#   cache.abf             - a complete copy of every row you have loaded, including
#                           your prompt text, file paths, project names and session data
#   unappliedChanges.json - unsaved model edits, and your Windows username
#   localSettings.json    - DPAPI-encrypted data source credential bindings
# Power BI Desktop's own default ignores only two files inside this folder.
# The whole folder is ignored here on purpose - do not narrow this.
**/.pbi/

# Power BI Desktop temp / lock artifacts
*.pbix.tmp
~$*

# Build output produced by Release-Kit.ps1
/dist/
